OL,3,GNEWSA'Systemic failures' surrounding
OL,4,Aprisoner's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA draft report into Guernsey Prison
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of an inmate has
OL,8,Fraised "significant concerns" relating
OL,9,Fto suicide and self-harm prevention.
OL,11,FThe BBC has seen the initial draft of
OL,12,Fthe independent investigation into
OL,13,FDarren Salituri, aged 39, which
OL,14,Fdescribes his death as a suicide in the
OL,15,Fprison on 2 February 2026.
OL,17,FThe report also identifies shortcomings
OL,18,Fin safeguarding, governance and the
OL,19,Fday-to-day running of the prison.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
